{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>法國一間中學發生槍擊案，2人受傷，一名14歲學生被捕。</p><p></p><p>案發於東南部城市歐巴涅，當地周一早上一名14歲男生涉嫌帶著霰彈槍進入學校，開槍打傷校長和一名教師，其後被職員制服，傷者都沒有生命危險。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FR.SHOOT-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hYQ3RZ1rv71791813493.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當局正調查犯案動機，又稱沒有跡象顯示案件與近期法國多處爆發的學生示威有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T14:39:05.513097+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T19:57:55.840588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:37:44.954088+00:00","content_hash":"85b022e849de45d6ea2b4f8b4af2bc528bce60f67bb67db555a643da45d5a7c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}